Dataset not included
--------------------
The model was developed and evaluated on a dataset of energy-optimal
trajectories that is covered by a non-disclosure agreement. That dataset is
confidential and is not distributed with this repository. No trajectories,
track profiles, train/validation split files, normalisation statistics,
trained model checkpoints or figures rendered from the dataset are included,
and none may be added to this repository. The license above grants no rights
over the dataset.

Origin of the results
---------------------
The aggregate results quoted in the README and in docs/ (mean RMSE 0.20 m/s,
peak velocity error 0.26 m/s, inference time under 10 ms on a CPU) are taken
from the author's project report. They were measured on the confidential
dataset and cannot be reproduced from this repository alone.

